ASSIGN THEM WITH THE FDOT REBAR PROGRAM BEFORE ISSUE.\P3. H IS THE STRAIGHT TAIL BEYOND EACH 135?? HOOK. OPEN STIRRUP LEGS A AND E ARE TURNED IN PLAN TO CLEAR THE PILE.\P4. VARYING LENGTHS: END BENT 1 5D1: 6 @ 4'-11", 16 @ 5'-0", 16 @ 5'-1", 4 @ 5'-2
